$ L_1 = -P_1 C^T R^(-1) = mat(-11.0669; -17.9455; -9.4423; -15.6669) $

$ sigma(A + L_1 C) = {-1.5603 plus.minus 3.2739i, quad -0.7398 plus.minus 1.1239i} $

Для пары $(alpha Q, R)$:

